.TH SWAYDESK-DRAWER 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.8" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-drawer \- full\-screen application grid
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-drawer
.br
.B swaydesk\-drawer
start
.SH DESCRIPTION
The full\-screen grid of applications, with search and the user folders.
.PP
Without arguments, shows or hides the grid of the resident process; without one, it becomes the resident process, already open.
.PP
The session runs it under the name sway\-drawer (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-drawer); the process name is sway\-drawer too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B start
Start the hidden resident process, at login.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR swaydesk\-dock (1)
